      "cooked": "<p>Always working</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-327-creative-process-two-new-heroes-we-somewhat-recently-made-up\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-327-creative-process-two-new-heroes-we-somewhat-recently-made-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a207b25d5dc8a6620aab8ce801ba438ae9da3f25.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"837B72\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-327-creative-process-two-new-heroes-we-somewhat-recently-made-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #327 - Creative Process: Two New Heroes We Somewhat...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>It's our first Creative Process in quite some time!&nbsp; Show Notes:&nbsp; Run Time: 2:05:14 I was all set to read two long-form bios today... but it turns out, that's insufficient. So, buckle up! We've got a lot to get through today.&nbsp; How did...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
