      "created_at": "2026-09-01T21:26:59.665Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, so four bios! I do like this format, I think I wouldn’t mind seeing it once in a while, like less than once a month, or maybe just less than one per episode where they appear, going forward?</p>\n<p>It’s cool to get the full Sentinel Comics Frankenstein story finally. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> I do love that they wrote him so that you don’t have to make the distinction between the monster and the man, just throw that naming argument out the window. XD</p>\n<p>Bodybuilder: Oh no, she’s hot.</p>\n<p>I was surprised to hear Deathfiend here! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Pleasantly so. And now we’ve got the full story! And Lady Deathfiend! Oh no, she’s hot!</p>\n<p>Kakugo however, I’m going to say, I’m less enthusiastic about at first blush, but I’m going to reserve final judgment till I see what others have to say about him. It’s definitely at least partially because he’s got more hard edge, staying an anti-hero like they say later.</p>\n<p>So post-Oblivaeon, Wipeout becomes Wipein, got it.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2026-09-01T21:26:59.665Z",
