      "raw": "Okay, so four bios! I do like this format, I think I wouldn't mind seeing it once in a while, like less than once a month, or maybe just less than one per episode where they appear, going forward?\n\nIt's cool to get the full Sentinel Comics Frankenstein story finally. :) I do love that they wrote him so that you don't have to make the distinction between the monster and the man, just throw that naming argument out the window. XD\n\nBodybuilder: Oh no, she's hot.\n\nI was surprised to hear Deathfiend here! :D Pleasantly so. And now we've got the full story! And Lady Deathfiend! Oh no, she's hot!\n\nKakugo however, I'm going to say, I'm less enthusiastic about at first blush, but I'm going to reserve final judgment till I see what others have to say about him. It's definitely at least partially because he's got more hard edge, staying an anti-hero like they say later.\n\nSo post-Oblivaeon, Wipeout becomes Wipein, got it.",
