      "cooked": "<p>Body Builder very in her nature barrows pieces of the “I Zombie” story</p>\n<p>[ghost samurai edgelord] fills some space Darkstrife + Painstake and early Parse leave open. Agree Take that he would not be a character I would follow but absolutely a character that should exist in the setting</p>\n<p>Christopher and Adam forgot there is a character with Density Control. Guise-Cat at D6. one of the things where “normal cat” works with the powers, I have known many cats that are were heavier and lighter that you think at different times.</p>",
